<title>FRANCE: Primagaz sees 10-15 pct rise in 96 results.</title>
<headline>Primagaz sees 10-15 pct rise in 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primagaz said on Wednesday that it expected a rise of between 10 and 15 percent in its full-year result.</p>
<p>It made the forecast in a results statement which showed a 21 percent rise in first-half net attributable profit to 218 million francs.</p>
<p>It cited strength in sales volumes, robust margins and a good Italian performance.</p>
</text>
